{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q032","title":"吸蟲感染來源：植物、魚與螞蟻","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"fc58cf710359dfc0509ce2c5093690d8c191ae304af3804871f3361ee8842713","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_ee90c48a1c288191bc647aa0a542d107","sourceAnchor":"q32","shortHtml":"<p>官方採<strong>A：①牛羊肝吸蟲與②薑片蟲</strong>，兩者都可經由附有<strong>囊蚴（metacercaria）</strong>的水生植物造成感染。不過，植物是囊蚴附著的<strong>傳播載體或表面</strong>，不是寄生蟲在其中發育的真正中間宿主；這兩種吸蟲的生物學中間宿主都是螺。作答保留題目要考的「植物相關感染」配對，概念上則把載體與宿主分清楚。</p>","html":"<div><h2>吸蟲感染來源：植物、魚與螞蟻</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：A</p><h3>答案是①②，但題幹的「中間宿主」用語要修正</h3>\n<p>官方採<strong>A：①牛羊肝吸蟲與②薑片蟲</strong>，兩者都可經由附有<strong>囊蚴（metacercaria）</strong>的水生植物造成感染。不過，植物是囊蚴附著的<strong>傳播載體或表面</strong>，不是寄生蟲在其中發育的真正中間宿主；這兩種吸蟲的生物學中間宿主都是螺。作答保留題目要考的「植物相關感染」配對，概念上則把載體與宿主分清楚。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>寄生蟲</th><th>中間宿主／附著載體</th><th>人體主要感染來源與成蟲位置</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>①牛羊肝吸蟲</strong></td><td>淡水螺；囊蚴附著水生植物等表面</td><td>攝入囊蚴；幼蟲穿越腸壁、肝實質後，成蟲在膽道</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>②薑片蟲</strong></td><td>淡水螺；囊蚴附著水生植物</td><td>攝入囊蚴；成蟲在小腸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>③中華肝吸蟲</td><td>第一中間宿主為螺，第二為淡水魚</td><td>食入含囊蚴的魚；成蟲在膽道</td></tr>\n<tr><td>④槍狀肝吸蟲</td><td>第一中間宿主為陸生螺，第二為螞蟻</td><td>意外吞入帶囊蚴的螞蟻；成蟲在膽道</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>四圖均為CDC DPDx現成公版原圖，完整保留原標示；原網站免費提供，來源連結集中列於下方。本讀本不代表CDC背書。HTML可點開圖像檢視原尺寸。</p>\n<p>因此，B把魚與螞蟻兩條路徑放在一起，C與D則各混入一個不符植物附著路徑的物種。<strong>答案A對應題目的傳播關聯；「植物＝真正中間宿主」則不是應帶走的定義。</strong></p>\n<p>①與②的相同點是<strong>植物表面的囊蚴可被吃入</strong>，差別在於後續寄居位置。臨床延伸可把牛羊肝吸蟲分成早期肝實質移行與後期膽道疾病；薑片蟲則以腸道病變為主。這比單背「水生植物有兩種蟲」更能接到症狀與定位。</p>\n<h3>看①②：螺之後接植物，進入人體後卻走向不同</h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:2000px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.2430080795525171\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/2cc46d25bdccd4863579a04cbab62700e1997b22d4f74e860eaaada0a88d2cec.jpg\" alt=\"牛羊肝吸蟲螺到水生植物及肝膽移行生活史\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1609\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/2cc46d25bdccd4863579a04cbab62700e1997b22d4f74e860eaaada0a88d2cec.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>①牛羊肝吸蟲</strong>：循螺旁箭頭找植物上的囊蚴，再看人體內通往肝膽的路徑。植物承載囊蚴，真正的中間宿主是圖下方的螺。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:553px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.271264367816092\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/960ba6fbc63f4ea857397e360f4babababd1183faa2e8aca106914c608de0574.gif\" alt=\"薑片蟲螺到植物及人體小腸生活史\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"553\" height=\"435\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/960ba6fbc63f4ea857397e360f4babababd1183faa2e8aca106914c608de0574.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>②薑片蟲</strong>：同樣經螺與水生植物，但人體內成蟲位置是小腸，不會因傳播載體相同就變成肝吸蟲。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n\n<h3>看③④：魚與螞蟻才是第二中間宿主</h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:2000px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3106159895150722\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/fa7045a79a4ce381f2a5e5bfeab4a9ed959d9c0ae1aa9c41f7eca9f4ba3cb6f6.jpg\" alt=\"中華肝吸蟲螺到淡水魚及膽道的生活史\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1526\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/fa7045a79a4ce381f2a5e5bfeab4a9ed959d9c0ae1aa9c41f7eca9f4ba3cb6f6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>③中華肝吸蟲</strong>：找螺之後的魚，人體是因攝入魚體內囊蚴而感染。圖中水域不等於水生植物傳播。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:2000px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.309757694826457\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/18582b50b112e0ffd7fca6d5b91c599c96491ff33c9bb7d636555e09f2163c5c.jpg\" alt=\"槍狀肝吸蟲陸生螺到螞蟻再到終宿主的生活史\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1527\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/18582b50b112e0ffd7fca6d5b91c599c96491ff33c9bb7d636555e09f2163c5c.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>④槍狀肝吸蟲</strong>：找陸生螺、螞蟻與終宿主的連接。即使人吃蔬菜時誤吞螞蟻，宿主仍是螞蟻，不能把蔬菜當作囊蚴發育宿主。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第32題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/fascioliasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：牛羊肝吸蟲、螺與植物表面囊蚴</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/fasciolopsiasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：薑片蟲與小腸成蟲</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/clonorchiasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：中華肝吸蟲之螺及魚中間宿主</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/dicrocoeliasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：槍狀肝吸蟲之陸生螺及螞蟻</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":4,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：A"}